      en: ["Zogota contains iron ore with a grade often exceeding 60% iron content.", "The export strategy utilizes the existing railway corridor through Liberia.", "The mine is located in a remote, forested area of southeastern Guinea.", "Niron Metals is currently leading the redevelopment of the Zogota project.", "It is classified as a high-grade Direct Shipping Ore (DSO) deposit.", "The project is a significant example of West African cross-border economic cooperation."],
