      en: ["Konta serves as a dedicated export terminal for the Ashapura mining operations.", "The port is located on a river estuary within the Forécariah region.", "It employs a barge-based transshipment system for bulk carriers.", "The facility was built to relieve congestion at the main Conakry port.", "The area is characterized by biodiverse and sensitive mangrove forests.", "Konta has become a significant economic engine for the southwestern coast."],
